      "infDivisible_convPow: ID closed under convolution powers",
      "infDivisible_dirac: δ₀ is infinitely divisible",
      "charFun_convPow: φ_{μ^{*n}}(t) = φ_μ(t)^n",
      "infDivisible_submonoid: ID distributions form a convolution submonoid"
    ],
