    "insights": [
      "Key insight for convPow_dist: use convolution_interchange to reshuffle (μ*ν)^{*(n+1)} into μ^{*(n+1)} * ν^{*(n+1)}",
      "Key insight for infDivisible_convPow: take ρ = k-th root of μ, then (ρ^{*n})^{*k} = ρ^{*(n*k)} = μ^{*n}",
